sequenceDiagram
    actor Client
    participant PostResource
    participant PostService
    participant PostgreSQL
    
    Note over Client,PostgreSQL: Find Post by ID - REST API Flow
    
    Client->>PostResource: GET /posts/{id}
    Note right of Client: Client sends GET request to /posts/{id}
    
    activate PostResource
    PostResource->>PostResource: findById(id)
    Note right of PostResource: PostResource.findById receives path variable id
    
    PostResource->>PostService: findById(id)
    Note right of PostResource: PostResource calls PostService.findById(id)
    
    activate PostService
    PostService->>PostgreSQL: SELECT * FROM post WHERE id = ?
    Note right of PostService: PostService retrieves Post from database
    
    activate PostgreSQL
    PostgreSQL-->>PostService: return post row
    Note right of PostgreSQL: Post object from database
    deactivate PostgreSQL
    
    PostService-->>PostResource: return post
    Note right of PostService: PostService returns Post object
    deactivate PostService
    
    PostResource->>PostResource: ResponseEntity.ok(post)
    Note right of PostResource: PostResource wraps Post in ResponseEntity
    
    PostResource-->>Client: HTTP 200 with Post JSON
    Note right of PostResource: ResponseEntity.ok().body(obj) returns HTTP 200 with Post data
    deactivate PostResource